      "description": "Per-target probe success ratio over 5 minutes: UP above 99.5%, DEGRADED between 50% and 99.5%, DOWN at or below 50%. The 5m window matters: probe intervals up to 5m plus 30s push batching leave fewer than two samples in shorter windows, making rate() return nothing.",
